Patch 6.1b.012
Problem:    Multi-byte: When 'showbreak' is set and a double-wide character
	    doesn't fit at the right window edge the cursor gets stuck there.
	    Using cursor-left gets stuck when 'virtualedit' is set.  (Eric
	    Long)
