Patch 6.1.374 (extra)
Problem:    MS-Windows: Cannot build GvimExt with MingW or Cygwin.
Solution:   Add makefile and modified resource files. (Rene de Zwart)
	    Also support Cygwin. (Alejandro Lopez_Valencia)
