	    (Yasuhiro Matsumoto)  Also fix typecast problem.
Files:	    src/gui_w32.c, src/os_mswin.c

Patch 6.1.457
Problem:    An empty register in viminfo causes conversion to fail.
Solution:   Don't convert an empty string. (Yasuhiro Matsumoto)
