~h|	<char-0x1FC7> " GREEK SMALL LETTER ETA WITH PERISPOMENI AND
		      " YPOGEGRAMMENI
~v|	<char-0x1FF7> " GREEK SMALL LETTER OMEGA WITH PERISPOMENI AND
